<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;">Desolatum - Ship Hub theme (draft 2). Dark lo-fi industrial ambience. B minor, 60 BPM, 32 bars. Master channel has a Bitcrush (16 kHz, 8-bit, 75% wet) for the gritty sound. Loop markers cover the whole song; export with &quot;Export between loop markers&quot; for a seamless game loop.</p></body></html>]]></projectnotes>
